# Apple design system

- Semantic colors and radii live in `src/app/globals.css` (`--background`, `--foreground`, `--muted`, etc.).
- Prefer existing `src/components/ui/*` (Button, Card, Badge) over one-off styled divs.
- Typography: clear hierarchy — hero titles large and tight; body text muted where secondary.
- Spacing: generous section padding; use `PageShell` max-width and vertical rhythm.
- Motion: subtle transitions only; respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Dark mode: use CSS variables — do not hardcode `#fff` / `#000` in components.

When adding components, match existing shadcn + Tailwind patterns in the repo.
